ose of a single request. For an append-only event log, the required property is idempotence. The log cannot require safety because appending is inherently a mutation. But it must require idempotence because at-least-once delivery means the writer's append request may be received and processed multiple times, and the log must remain correct — containing each logical event exactly once regardless of how many times the delivery layer retries.\nMECHANISM: Safe = no side effects (read-only). Idempotent = side effects allowed but inva\n\n== PAIRWISE RULINGS ==\n\n== UNRESOLVED RIVALRIES (multiple survivors, undecided) ==\nquestion-4dd976434b71f6e815508e52e995af6b: [6c4abc40a33f], [7e25700ea502], [03999d039dc1], [619b760e99d7], [748e0b32303a], [08240ac1f383], [cded8b977c50], [8e394f49e7f0], [5d8c3d571ed7], [519095e5cfa6]\n\n== REFUTED POSITIONS (with the arguments that felled them) ==\n\n\nDIRECTIVE: from this record ONLY, produce the committed thesis (rules in your role brief). Cite bracketed ids exactly.","omissions":{"argued_refutations":0,"catalog_items":0,"open_rivals":0,"pairwise_rulings":0,"survivors":0},"open_rivals":[{"problem_ref":"question-4dd976434b71f6e815508e52e995af6b","rendered_text":"question-4dd976434b71f6e815508e52e995af6b: [6c4abc40a33f], [7e25700ea502], [03999d039dc1], [619b760e99d7], [748e0b32303a], [08240ac1f383], [cded8b977c50], [8e394f49e7f0], [5d8c3d571ed7], [519095e5cfa6]","rival_refs":["6c4abc40a33fc6262d6f149079f620d6d42a8edafc3222cc8ce003e69e2b60e8","7e25700ea5020e50f6bb7accdf036b990c66f7155e2c517d545a95d73338006f","03999d039dc162aaf7537c680eece5767660079c4b661c53d5b5614f720b6556","619b760e99d71edad675228b3450195231353faa8fb263a84b746a2073ca1b68","748e0b32303ad955da49166af6f436a6b8b6f52d58e7550d08cc608cb5100dde","08240ac1f383f0071c84f068164f72713434b44a727553dbde5fcf445d82ddd5","cded8b977c502922870c0972bda9fcaf7458e11559be202d588bfcd3c98253f3","8e394f49e7f08af01a5485db4afa96c57bd95d7bd742d77f6a1b22f4c002c8ef","5d8c3d571ed7d5905c4f583889e38ae50